sollang: usage: sollang build [<source.slg> ... | --project <sollang.project|directory> | --workspace <sollang.workspace|directory> --package <name>] [--product <name>] [-o <output>] [--target windows-x64|linux-x64|wasm32-browser] [--library] [--llvm <dir>] [--jobs <positive-integer>] [-O0|-O1|-O2|-O3] [--keep-temps] [--locked]
